{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Owned local customer text",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Local authenticated testing only. Current Registration/Profile/V2 receipt/TTL, actor grants, source and policy are checked before/after default fixed Luna execution. Retained Session-task High history can identify its frozen Sol model; public requests cannot select a model or profile. Explicit consent starts a session; each durable UUID turn is dispatched once, with no tools except server knowledge.resolve and typed need.patch. Revocation denies late output and preserves observed token usage. Read does not renew TTL. Need values remain proposed, with actual client-event provenance. No live channel, contact, email, voice, acquisition, postcall, learning or deployment activation; calibration remains UNVERIFIED."
  },
